{
    "title": "Solitaire",
    "description": "Solitaire is a classic Klondike solitaire card game. Solitaire is so interesting and so popular, people all over the world like playing solitaire to relax themselves. When people say \"Solitaire\", it is generally referred to as the Klondike solitaire. Klondike solitaire is most popular and most classic solitaire card game, compared to the other solitaire card games, like Spider Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, and TriPeaks Solitaire. \r\n\r\nLet's install this perfect solitaire to train your brain and relax your life! This Classic Klondike has lots of good gameplay and pretty art.\r\n\r\nBackgrounds\r\nThis classic solitaire has hundreds of pretty backgrounds, when playing this Klondike solitaire card game, you will immerse in beautiful view, in mountain, in forest, and so on. You will also love the sweet animals in the backgrounds.\r\n\r\nCard Faces & Card Backs\r\nIn this classic solitaire, there are tens of card faces and card backs, you can choose the one you mostly like.\r\n\r\nEvents\r\nSolitaire Klondike has many events and activities, such as sea adventure pass, tarot card pass, design houses and gardens, star chests to unlock, and so on.\r\n\r\nDon't hesitate, let's install this perfect solitaire card game!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Solitaire is a classic Klondike solitaire card game. Solitaire is so interesting and so popular, people all over the world like playing solitaire to relax themselves. When people say &quot;Solitaire&quot;, it is generally referred to as the Klondike solitaire. Klondike solitaire is most popular and most classic solitaire card game, compared to the other solitaire card games, like Spider Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, and TriPeaks Solitaire. <br><br>Let&#39;s install this perfect solitaire to train your brain and relax your life! This Classic Klondike has lots of good gameplay and pretty art.<br><br>Backgrounds<br>This classic solitaire has hundreds of pretty backgrounds, when playing this Klondike solitaire card game, you will immerse in beautiful view, in mountain, in forest, and so on. You will also love the sweet animals in the backgrounds.<br><br>Card Faces &amp; Card Backs<br>In this classic solitaire, there are tens of card faces and card backs, you can choose the one you mostly like.<br><br>Events<br>Solitaire Klondike has many events and activities, such as sea adventure pass, tarot card pass, design houses and gardens, star chests to unlock, and so on.<br><br>Don&#39;t hesitate, let&#39;s install this perfect solitaire card game!",
